WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Just get up early

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:07,750
Why do you still have to work overtime now? System

3
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:09,980
If Xiong Xiong could be a store employee

4
00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:11,980
Then I should still be able to take care of people, okay?

5
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:13,980
Depends on what kind of employees you want to hire

6
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,490
What types are there?

7
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:16,490
Divided into two categories

8
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:17,490
Original product staff

9
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:18,490
i.e. virtual employees

10
00:00:18,490 --> 00:00:19,490
Let’s talk about virtual employees first

11
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:21,490
Virtual employees are similar to Xiongxiong

12
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:22,490
Belongs to system-generated products

13
00:00:22,490 --> 00:00:23,490
capable of growth

14
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:24,490
You can spend machine points to raise the flag

15
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:25,490
Additional languages can also be activated

16
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:28,490
Various advanced subsystems such as logic understanding, but

17
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:30,490
Virtual workers have an Achilles heel

18
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:31,490
Take Bear as an example

19
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:33,490
His Achilles heel is fire

20
00:00:33,490 --> 00:00:36,450
But the advantages of virtual employees

21
00:00:36,450 --> 00:00:37,450
No need to eat

22
00:00:37,450 --> 00:00:38,450
no need to sleep

23
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:40,450
Can work for you 24 hours a day

24
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:43,020
It turns out that Bear is afraid of fire
